        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.24,
          "end": 5.31,
          "en": "-: Now till this point, we have talked about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.31,
          "end": 8.64,
          "en": "one of the Stereotype Annotation, which is your Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.64,
          "end": 10.38,
          "en": "So if you want Spring to manage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.38,
          "end": 12.15,
          "en": "your class or the object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.15,
          "end": 15.87,
          "en": "we have to write @Component on top of it, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.87,
          "end": 19.38,
          "en": "Now, this is not the only Stereotype Annotation available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.38,
          "end": 21.45,
          "en": "See, if we talk about any application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.45,
          "end": 23.43,
          "en": "you'll be having multiple layers there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.43,
          "end": 25.02,
          "en": "Now, this is not a web application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.02,
          "end": 28.17,
          "en": "this is a simple console-based application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.17,
          "end": 30.3,
          "en": "But let's say if you have a full-fledged application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.3,
          "end": 31.95,
          "en": "you'll be having multiple layers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 31.95,
          "end": 33.93,
          "en": "So normally, you'll be having a Client.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 33.93,
          "end": 35.88,
          "en": "Now, Client will interact with the Server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 35.88,
          "end": 37.89,
          "en": "And of course, when you build an application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 37.89,
          "end": 39.66,
          "en": "you will also have a Database there, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 39.66,
          "end": 41.67,
          "en": "And of course, when we talk about web application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 41.67,
          "end": 43.83,
          "en": "we'll be talking about Spring Web later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 43.83,
          "end": 45.57,
          "en": "But just to give you a scenario,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 45.57,
          "end": 46.44,
          "en": "we have a Client,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 46.44,
          "end": 47.52,
          "en": "we have a Server in between,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 47.52,
          "end": 48.896,
          "en": "and then we have a Database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 48.896,
          "end": 52.14,
          "en": "Now in this Server as well, we have multiple layers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 52.14,
          "end": 54,
          "en": "Now, when you want to work with data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 54,
          "end": 55.95,
          "en": "of course, that's why we have Database there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 55.95,
          "end": 58.74,
          "en": "And in every application you'll be having",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 58.74,
          "end": 60,
          "en": "some kind of Database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 60,
          "end": 62.22,
          "en": "Now, if you want to fetch this data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 62.22,
          "end": 63.053,
          "en": "so let's have a,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 63.053,
          "end": 65.85,
          "en": "if a client wants a data, the request goes to the Server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 65.85,
          "end": 67.71,
          "en": "Server sends a request to the Database,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 67.71,
          "end": 69.96000000000001,
          "en": "and Database says, \"Okay, that's your data.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 69.96000000000001,
          "end": 71.07,
          "en": "Get your data back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 71.07,
          "end": 72.33,
          "en": "Data goes to the Server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 72.33,
          "end": 74.49,
          "en": "Server sends that data to the Client.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 74.49,
          "end": 76.02,
          "en": "Now, of course, depend upon Client,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 76.02,
          "end": 79.28999999999999,
          "en": "it can be a webpage, it can be only JSON data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 79.28999999999999,
          "end": 81.81,
          "en": "but ultimately, it is Server who is responsible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 81.81,
          "end": 83.55,
          "en": "to accept and return data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 83.55,
          "end": 85.83,
          "en": "Now, even this Server will have multiple layers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 85.83,
          "end": 87.9,
          "en": "So you'll be having a Controller.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 87.9,
          "end": 90.27,
          "en": "Again, we'll talk about this thing in detail later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 90.27,
          "end": 91.71000000000001,
          "en": "when we talk about Spring MVC,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 91.71000000000001,
          "end": 93.50999999999999,
          "en": "but we have a Controller.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 93.50999999999999,
          "end": 97.44,
          "en": "Now, Controller job is to only work with the request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 97.44,
          "end": 99.57,
          "en": "so whatever request you send from the Client.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 99.57,
          "end": 101.1,
          "en": "And if you want someone to handle that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 101.1,
          "end": 102.75,
          "en": "you will do it with help of Controller.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 102.75,
          "end": 104.52000000000001,
          "en": "Now, Controller says, \"My only job here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 104.52000000000001,
          "end": 107.25,
          "en": "is to accept the request and send data back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 107.25,
          "end": 109.62,
          "en": "My job is not to do any processing.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 109.62,
          "end": 111.27000000000001,
          "en": "What if you want to do any processing?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 111.27000000000001,
          "end": 114.27000000000001,
          "en": "In that case, we have to use something called a Service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 114.27000000000001,
          "end": 116.97,
          "en": "Now, Service is a layer who is responsible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 116.97,
          "end": 118.44,
          "en": "to do any kind of processing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 118.44,
          "end": 120.39,
          "en": "Let's say, if you want to add two numbers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 120.39,
          "end": 121.95,
          "en": "if you want to find a Factorial,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 121.95,
          "end": 124.11,
          "en": "if you want to find a Logic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 124.11,
          "end": 126,
          "en": "Let's say, \"Which is a best stock to invest in?\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 126,
          "end": 127.53,
          "en": "If you want to sort the product",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 127.53,
          "end": 129.84,
          "en": "based on their average rating.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 129.84,
          "end": 133.26,
          "en": "So all the thing will be done in the Service class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 133.26,
          "end": 136.07999999999998,
          "en": "Now, what if you want some data from Database?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 136.07999999999998,
          "end": 136.913,
          "en": "So let's say you're saying,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 136.913,
          "end": 137.746,
          "en": "\"Hey, you know what?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 137.746,
          "end": 140.55,
          "en": "I want to find best products within the range",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 140.55,
          "end": 142.89,
          "en": "of $10 to $100.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 142.89,
          "end": 144.75,
          "en": "Now, at this point, you don't have your data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 144.75,
          "end": 147.18,
          "en": "in your application, you have that in your Database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 147.18,
          "end": 148.44,
          "en": "But where you will do this processing?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 148.44,
          "end": 150.15,
          "en": "You will do the processing inside Service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 150.15,
          "end": 153.42000000000002,
          "en": "But unfortunately, Service don't have a data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 153.42000000000002,
          "end": 155.28,
          "en": "Now, Service has to connect with Database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 155.28,
          "end": 158.37,
          "en": "Now, in that case, you'll be having a layer in between,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 158.37,
          "end": 160.38,
          "en": "which will be your DAO layer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 160.38,
          "end": 162.24,
          "en": "which is called Data Access Object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 162.24,
          "end": 164.82,
          "en": "or we can say Repository.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 164.82,
          "end": 167.04,
          "en": "Now, this is a layer who is responsible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 167.04,
          "end": 169.82999999999998,
          "en": "to interact with Database, get the data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 169.82999999999998,
          "end": 170.67000000000002,
          "en": "give it to the Service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 170.67000000000002,
          "end": 172.8,
          "en": "Now, Service will do some processing on that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 172.8,
          "end": 174.87,
          "en": "and then give the data back to the Controller.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 174.87,
          "end": 176.1,
          "en": "So how is the flow?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 176.1,
          "end": 178.709,
          "en": "From the Client, data goes to the Controller,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 178.709,
          "end": 181.47,
          "en": "Controller says Service, Service sends to Repository,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 181.47,
          "end": 183.78,
          "en": "from Repository, request goes to Database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 183.78,
          "end": 185.79,
          "en": "Database says, \"Okay, this is your data.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 185.79,
          "end": 187.253,
          "en": "Repository sends back data to the Service,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 187.253,
          "end": 190.14,
          "en": "Service does the processing, give it back to the Controller,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 190.14,
          "end": 191.58,
          "en": "and Controller give it back to the Client.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 191.58,
          "end": 193.26,
          "en": "That's the entire flow here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 193.26,
          "end": 195.81,
          "en": "So that means we have multiple layers, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 195.81,
          "end": 198.54,
          "en": "Of course, we'll talk about Controller later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 198.54,
          "end": 201.03,
          "en": "but we have two more layers here, which we'll talk about,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 201.03,
          "end": 202.89,
          "en": "the Service and Repository.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 202.89,
          "end": 206.28,
          "en": "The job of Service layer is to do only processing part,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 206.28,
          "end": 209.16,
          "en": "not interact with the Client or not interact with Database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 209.16,
          "end": 210.72,
          "en": "Repository's job is to connect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 210.72,
          "end": 212.31,
          "en": "with Database and get the data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 212.31,
          "end": 215.64,
          "en": "Now, if you want to create those classes in Java,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 215.64,
          "end": 217.56,
          "en": "which annotation you're going to use?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 217.56,
          "end": 218.88,
          "en": "In fact, let me just do that here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 218.88,
          "end": 219.99,
          "en": "So what I will do is I will create,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 219.99,
          "end": 222.54,
          "en": "I will add extra layers here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 222.54,
          "end": 224.61,
          "en": "So let me close this desktop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 224.61,
          "end": 226.74,
          "en": "Let's only work with laptop here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 226.74,
          "end": 228.54,
          "en": "I don't need all these things open.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 228.54,
          "end": 229.71,
          "en": "Let me close everything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 229.71,
          "end": 231.32999999999998,
          "en": "So let's say we only have laptop here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 231.32999999999998,
          "end": 233.16,
          "en": "And imagine we do have a database",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 233.16,
          "end": 235.05,
          "en": "for laptop somewhere, okay?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 235.05,
          "end": 237.87,
          "en": "So how will we create this layer?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 237.87,
          "end": 240.66,
          "en": "So this is your, imagine this is your Client layer, okay?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 240.66,
          "end": 242.79,
          "en": "Or maybe you can imagine this as a Controller if you want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 242.79,
          "end": 245.52,
          "en": "but at this point, Client make much, much more sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 245.52,
          "end": 246.84,
          "en": "So let's say this is your Client layer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 246.84,
          "end": 249.66,
          "en": "From this layer, you are requesting to the Server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 249.66,
          "end": 252.27,
          "en": "Now on Server, let's replace Controller.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 252.27,
          "end": 253.95,
          "en": "The request directly goes to a Service layer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 253.95,
          "end": 255.3,
          "en": "Now, what Service will do?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 255.3,
          "end": 257.28,
          "en": "Let's say you want 10,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 257.28,
          "end": 259.23,
          "en": "you want data about laptop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 259.23,
          "end": 261.3,
          "en": "Now the Client sends request to the Service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 261.3,
          "end": 263.31,
          "en": "Service will say, \"Okay, I will give you the data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 263.31,
          "end": 265.47,
          "en": "but I have to get data from the Repository.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 265.47,
          "end": 266.91,
          "en": "So you'll be having one more layer there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 266.91,
          "end": 268.32,
          "en": "But how do we create those layers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 268.32,
          "end": 269.91,
          "en": "and how do we annotate that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
